    "updated_at": "2026-09-22T12:55:56Z",
    "body": "Mozilla is supportive. This seems reasonable for cases where it's hard or impossible to set headers and the external script workaround moves complexity to the web developer, which violates the [Priority of Constituencies](https://www.w3.org/TR/html-design-principles/#priority-of-constituencies) design principle.",
